Subject: Unconditional `regvm_cur` on the light return

What this does
  Unconditional `regvm_cur` on the light return.

Why we need it
  The light return loaded the caller's `sf` to decide whether to publish it as the light chain head.

What it adds
  Store the caller unconditionally; `regvm_light_head` filters `regvm_cur`/`rv_light` to light frames at every reader.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
